{"key": "f7922339bb53f674efd264c7df16ae9c247439aff835acbe5e4160a714123eaa", "response": {"error": null, "latency_s": 0.05, "raw": {"choices": [{"message": {"content": "```python\ndef merge_intervals(intervals):\n    if not intervals: return []\n    s = sorted(intervals, key=lambda x: x[0])\n    res = [s[0]]\n    for cur in s[1:]:\n        prev = res[-1]\n        if cur[0] <= prev[1]: prev[1] = max(prev[1], cur[1])\n        else: res.append(cur)\n    return res\n```", "tool_calls": []}}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 10, "prompt_tokens": 10}}}}
